<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Oslava: Náměšť–Lamberk–Kraví Hora traverse — Náměšť–Lamberk–Kraví Hora–Rapotice whole traverse [planning only — not navigation-grade]</name><desc>Start on the walking forecourt at Náměšť nad Oslavou railway station. Follow the marked red route into the left-bank Oslava valley, past Vlasák and the rocky Divoká Oslava ground. Take the full marked excursion to Lamberk ruins and return to its trail junction. Continue through Dlouhá Oslava and Skřipina to Kraví Hora ruins, cross the footbridge at Senoradský mlýn, and continue through Panorama to the walking platform junction at Rapotice station. Approximate planning totals are 25.6 km, 480 m ascent, 375 m descent and 7 hours; allow additional time for conditions and stops. Distance is calculated from the complete mapped course; climbing and time remain approximate planning estimates without an elevation profile.

Walk only in suitable low river flow and safe, dry, snow-free daylight. A required seasonal ford and its adjoining riverside track become submerged at medium or higher water. Verify river conditions and the current state of the ford and bridges locally before setting out; passage is not guaranteed. Do not enter flooded or unsafe ground. Narrow rocky riverside paths, steep climbs, slippery rocks and crossings demand careful footing. Stay on the adopted marked reserve paths, respect habitat protection, gates, forest operations, closure notices and on-site signs, and take no unmarked shortcuts. Approach and exit include roads 392 and 393 and rural road crossings with traffic; no crossing-safety survey is provided. Confirm outward and return train service separately. If any required section is closed, prohibited, submerged or unsafe, this complete itinerary is unavailable.

Route geometry: © OpenStreetMap contributors — https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright; ODbL 1.0 — https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/. Actual complete source captures: https://api.openstreetmap.org/api/0.6/map?bbox=16.14,49.16,16.2,49.22; https://api.openstreetmap.org/api/0.6/map?bbox=16.14,49.125,16.27,49.16; https://api.openstreetmap.org/api/0.6/map?bbox=16.2,49.16,16.27,49.205. Changes: literal ordered original walking and road vertices, including the full Lamberk ruins out-and-back and railway walking endpoints; repeated shared junction vertices removed. Canonical display simplified using original source vertices. No private publisher coordinates, interpolation, synthetic connectors or elevations. Planning only; not navigation-grade.

